  "chapter": "LV_LOW_VOLTAGE",
  "description": "While steam and other Thermal Expansion dynamos produce FE, this energy cannot directly power GregTech machines.

The solution is to employ §l§aconverters§r, which can convert your §2FE into EU§r. To configure a converter to output EU, simply right-click it with a soft mallet to change its mode from §aEU to FE§r to §2FE to EU§r.

Keep in mind, however, that these converters are still subject to §avoltage/amperage rules§r, so §l§4be careful!§r",
